<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:04.233" end="00:00:04.833" style="s2">Siheon!</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.668" end="00:00:10.365" style="s2">Hey. Where are you headed?</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.668" end="00:00:13.365" style="s2">Class.</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.701" end="00:00:17.064" style="s2">Got any plans after school?</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.068" end="00:00:21.496" style="s2">I&#39;m going to the bookstore.</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.168" end="00:00:25.229" style="s2">Can I come with you?</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.735" end="00:00:28.262" style="s2">Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.868" end="00:00:30.461" style="s2">Really?</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.168" end="00:01:00.022" style="s2">See you at the bookstore at 4? I&#39;ll be waiting :)</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.168" end="00:01:30.549" style="s2">Siheon! Over here!</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.001" end="00:01:39.714" style="s2">You&#39;re early.</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.235" end="00:01:43.547" style="s2">You got here before me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.768" end="00:01:45.946" style="s2">Nah, I just got here.</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.635" end="00:01:49.445" style="s2">Liar.</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.001" end="00:01:52.745" style="s2">Come on. Let&#39;s go in.</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.535" end="00:02:15.240" style="s2">So, what are you looking for?</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.568" end="00:02:18.306" style="s2">Just... something.</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.101" end="00:02:21.106" style="s2">You come here a lot?</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.335" end="00:02:26.971" style="s2">Sometimes.</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.568" end="00:02:37.969" style="s2">You really like books, huh?</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.768" end="00:02:44.234" style="s2">Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.801" end="00:02:49.700" style="s2">That&#39;s cute.</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.035" end="00:02:54.732" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.201" end="00:02:56.965" style="s2">Nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.501" end="00:03:11.562" style="s2">Have you read this?</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.235" end="00:03:14.862" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.335" end="00:03:16.361" style="s2">What&#39;s it about?</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.335" end="00:03:24.093" style="s2">It&#39;s about...</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.435" end="00:03:30.025" style="s2">a guy who finds a letter that was never delivered.</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.435" end="00:03:32.592" style="s2">He decides to deliver it himself, but</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.435" end="00:03:41.023" style="s2">But?</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.135" end="00:03:47.089" style="s2">Nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.301" end="00:04:11.850" style="s2">See you.</p>
<p begin="00:04:25.901" end="00:04:27.281" style="s2">Why are you following me?</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.035" end="00:04:30.380" style="s2">I&#39;m going this way too.</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.868" end="00:04:35.779" style="s2">Liar. Again.</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.068" end="00:04:37.945" style="s2">You got me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.435" end="00:04:41.711" style="s2">Just humor me, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.568" end="00:04:58.041" style="s2">Did you find what you were looking for?</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.935" end="00:05:01.874" style="s2">Not really.</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.401" end="00:05:04.507" style="s2">We should come back sometime.</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.535" end="00:05:09.206" style="s2">Okay.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
